# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions.
#
# Only for undefined behaviour inside third-party headers that awlib has
# no way to fix. Anything reported in awlib's own code is a bug.
#
# Syntax:  <check>:<substring of a function name, file name or module name>
#          e.g. alignment:libfoo, vptr:SomeType
# Docs:    https://clang.llvm.org/docs/UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer.html#issue-suppression
